</tr>
<tr>
<td>BASE</td>
<td>Hardened steel</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ADDED FEATURES</td>
<td>Cushioned rubber for digital gauge protection, Auto off, Dunlop valve adapter, Presta valve adapter, Ball / bladder heads, Hose dock</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>SIZE</td>
