<li>Pedal body in carbon-fibre tech-polymers
<ul>
<li>Low stack height (10.5 mm)</li>
<li>Low q-factor (+53mm)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Modular design – interchangeable pedal bodies</li>
<li>Made in Italy</li>
