  ('vittoria-650b-terreno-t30-fine-loose-gravel-endurance', 'Vittoria 650b Terreno T30 Fine Loose Gravel Endurance', 'vittoria', 'wheels-tyres-tubes', 'gravel-tyres', '<p>The champion of fine loose gravel</p>

